    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What sustainability measures do we propose to implement in the solution, and how will we ensure that we proposal aligns with The client environmental expectations and policies?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at we, a CSR & Sustainability officer at Faber IA can propose several sustainability measures that align with the client's environmental expectations and policies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we has already conducted a bilan carbone, which demonstrates we commitment to understanding and reducing we carbon footprint.  we can propose hosting the solution on we green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which is located in the EU, uses renewable energy, and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud reuses heat, further reducing our green hosting partner, OuraneCloud environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce energy consumption, we can implement digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching. digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching will not only minimize the solution carbon footprint but also optimize the solution performance. we will also ensure that our proposal complies with The client sustainable development policy by providing a carbon reporting capability, which will enable The client to track the solution environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we has a published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, demonstrating we long-term commitment to sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By deploying the solution on a low-carbon infrastructure and implementing energy-efficient practices, we can contribute to reducing the environmental footprint of the client's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our proposal will align with The client environmental expectations and policies by providing a sustainable, energy-efficient solution that minimizes the solution carbon footprint while delivering the required performance and functionality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk179> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is seeking an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution to support hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, with the goal of improving the efficiency of staff and the quality and safety of care delivered to patients." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress patient pathway, and an efficient resumption of handling by another professional. 4." ;
