        ex:hasText "Our AI solution will be hosted on infrastructure that holds the French \"Hébergeur de Données de Santé\" (HDS) certification, ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with relevant regulations. infrastructure that holds the French \"Hébergeur de Données de Santé\" (HDS) certification will be located exclusively within the European Union, and no data will be transferred outside the European Union." ;
